            "label": "Address (Cordova)",
            "type": "Cluster",
            "description": "A postal address in the Republic of Cordova: the Default address lines and postal code by identifier, the Cordova city and province as the closed national lists. Members: address-line-1 (Default); address-line-2 (Default); City; Province; postal-code (Default).",
            "items": [
              {
                "component_id": "ncxxt7wgs7soxw7kbmapxvg3",
                "label": "Address (Line 1)",
                "type": "XdString",
                "description": "The first line of a street address: street number and name, or a post office box.",
